d&amp;datanum=189\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/I6d/189\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/I6d/189\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>3. 수업과 연계한 서논술형평가</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/613532682256718a9aaad240e3f60b5b5fb80c11\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" height=\"251\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/613532682256718a9aaad240e3f60b5b5fb80c11\" data-origin-width=\"1028\" data-origin-height=\"644\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/I6d/187\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/I6d/187</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/I6d/187\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=I6d&amp;datanum=187\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/I6d/187\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sed